  "aboutDeendoonBenefit4": "Record payments received and remaining balances.",
  "aboutDeendoonBenefit5": "Get clear reports on your debts.",
  "aboutDeendoonBenefit6": "Improve the recovery of money owed to you and your business's cash flow.",
  "aboutDeendoonConclusionHeading": "Conclusion",
  "aboutDeendoonConclusionParagraph": "DEENDOON is a modern assistant that simplifies debt management and strengthens customer follow-up, so your business gets paid on time.",
